[setreplay name="plaza001" storage="SundayDate/SundayDate_Plaza002.ks" target="replay_plaza"]

*plaza_cg
;FG003_6.png
[mask time="500" effect="fadeIn" ]
[chara_hide_all time="1" ]

[playbgm2 volume="40"  time="1000"  loop="true"  fadein="false"  storage="BGM0_title.mp3"  html5="false"  ]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/00.png" time="500"   ]
[if exp="!f.flag_replay" ]
    [setTime minutes="0" hours="15"]
[endif]
[mask_off time="500" effect="fadeOut" ]




[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0025.mp3"  ]
[messageON]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
きれいな眺めですね[r]
すてきです[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/01.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0026.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
ふふ……座るとなんだか[r]
ちからが抜けちゃいました[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/02.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0027.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
もう少し、[r]
このまま寄りかかってもいいですか？[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/01.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0028.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
……よかった[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/00.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0029.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
家族連れが多くて、こどももたくさんだったから[r]
わたしもつられて興奮してたみたいです[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/02.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0030.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
こどもって、守ってくれる人がいるから[r]
安心してへとへとになれる……のかな、なんて[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/00.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0031.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
先生といるといろんなことが[r]
何倍も楽しくなる理由がわかった気がします[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/01.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0032.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
――はい、先生はわたしの保護者さんです[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/02.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0033.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
それと、もうひとつ[r]
わかったんです[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/03.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0034.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
先生とわたしの関係[r]
ふくざつ……でもないけど、説明しにくくて[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/04.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0035.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
なんて言うのかな、って[r]
時々考えてたんですよ[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/01.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0036.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
でも、きっと、[r]
ただ“家族”でいいのかな、と思えてきたんです[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/03.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0037.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
わたしと先生は、友達だったり恋人だったり、[r]
いろんなかたちになれるけれども――[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/00.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0038.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
でもその前にまず家族だから、いっしょが[r]
当たり前で、安心できることなんです[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/01.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0039.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
最後はそこに帰ってこられるから、[r]
どんな関係になっても大丈夫なんだって信じられる[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/02.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0040.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
わたしの勝手なきもちのお話だったんですけど[r]
……そう思ってても、いいですか？[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/01.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0041.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
――……よかった[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DatePlaza/05.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0042.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
それじゃあ遠慮なく、もっとぎゅうって[r]
くっついちゃおうかな[p]
[_tb_end_text]
[eval exp="f.dateSuccess.plaza = true" ]

[messageInvisible]
[fadeinbgm2 volume="40"  time="3000"  loop="true"  fadein="false"  storage=&f.beforeBGM  html5="false"  ]
[endreplay]
[return]

;回想シーン用
*replay_plaza
[button name="myButton" fix="true" target="endReplay"  storage="macro_call.ks" enterimg="osawari/modoru_2.png"  graphic="osawari/modoru.png"  width="38"  height="38"  x="1249"  y="15"  cond="f.flag_replay"  ]
[replaySituSelect column="1" text="&tf.text"]

[setGlinkY num="2"]

[glink  color="btn_05_black"  text="初回時の内容"  _clickable_img="" target="*replay_plaza_check" size="24" x="auto"   y="&tf.glink1Y"  width="500"  height=""  preexp="0"  exp="f.isAwake = false,tf.situText1='初回時の内容',tf.storage='SundayDate/SundayDate_Plaza002.ks',tf.label='plaza_cg'"  clickse="se/s_kettei.mp3"   ]
[glink  color="btn_05_black" text="２回目以降の内容"  target="replay_plaza_check" size="24" x="auto"  y="&tf.glink2Y"  width="500"  height=""  preexp="0" exp="tf.situText1='２回目以降の内容',tf.storage='SundayDate/SundayDate_Plaza003.ks',tf.label='plaza_cg2'"  clickse="se/s_kettei.mp3"   ]
[s]
[s]

*replay_plaza_check
[columnUpdate column="1" text="&tf.situText1"]
[replaySituCheck]
[if exp="tf.isSituOK" ]
    [deleteSituColumn]
    [setButtonInTalk]
    [jump target="&tf.label" storage="&tf.storage"  ]
[else]
    [jump target="*replay_plaza" ]
[endif]

[endreplay]